{
  "version": 1,
  "id": "hammond-leslie",
  "name": "Hammond B3 + Leslie",
  "description": "Classic Hammond B3 organ through a Leslie rotary speaker cabinet.",
  "graph": {
    "modules": [
      {
        "id": "ctrl-1",
        "type": "control",
        "name": "Keyboard",
        "position": { "x": 120, "y": 120 },
        "params": {
          "cv": 0,
          "cvMode": "unipolar",
          "velocity": 1,
          "midiVelocity": true,
          "gate": 0,
          "glide": 0.01,
          "voices": 8
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "organ-1",
        "type": "pipe-organ",
        "name": "Hammond B3",
        "position": { "x": 320, "y": 120 },
        "params": {
          "frequency": 220,
          "drawbar16": 0.8,
          "drawbar8": 1.0,
          "drawbar4": 0.7,
          "drawbar223": 0.5,
          "drawbar2": 0.6,
          "drawbar135": 0.3,
          "drawbar113": 0.2,
          "drawbar1": 0.15,
          "voicing": 0,
          "chiff": 0.25,
          "percussion": 1,
          "percHarmonic": 1,
          "percDecay": 0,
          "percVolume": 0.8,
          "chorusVibrato": 5,
          "tremulant": 0.0,
          "tremRate": 6,
          "wind": 0.05,
          "brightness": 0.75
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "adsr-1",
        "type": "adsr",
        "name": "ADSR",
        "position": { "x": 520, "y": 320 },
        "params": {
          "attack": 0.005,
          "decay": 0.1,
          "sustain": 0.9,
          "release": 0.15
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "gain-1",
        "type": "gain",
        "name": "VCA",
        "position": { "x": 520, "y": 120 },
        "params": {
          "gain": 0.8
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "les-1",
        "type": "leslie",
        "name": "Leslie 122",
        "position": { "x": 720, "y": 120 },
        "params": {
          "speed": 0,
          "brake": 0,
          "drive": 0.25,
          "depth": 0.75,
          "mix": 1.0
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "reverb-1",
        "type": "reverb",
        "name": "Room",
        "position": { "x": 920, "y": 120 },
        "params": {
          "time": 0.45,
          "damp": 0.5,
          "preDelay": 10,
          "mix": 0.15
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "out-1",
        "type": "output",
        "name": "Main Out",
        "position": { "x": 1120, "y": 120 },
        "params": {
          "level": 1
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "notes-1",
        "type": "notes",
        "name": "Info",
        "position": { "x": 720, "y": 320 },
        "params": {
          "text": "HAMMOND B3 + LESLIE 122\n\nClassic rock/jazz organ sound.\nPercussion ON (3rd harmonic, fast decay).\nChorus/Vibrato: C2 scanner.\n\nSignal: Keyboard -> Pipe Organ -> VCA -> Leslie -> Reverb -> Out\n\nLeslie cabinet:\n- SLOW/FAST toggle = rotor speed\n- H/D Bal = horn vs drum balance\n- Mic Dist = close vs far mic\n- Ramp = spin-up speed\n\nTry:\n- Toggle SLOW/FAST while playing!\n- Percussion 2nd vs 3rd harmonic\n- Scanner V1-V3 (vibrato) / C1-C3 (chorus)\n- Drive 0.5+ = gritty rock organ"
        }
      }
    ],
    "connections": [
      {
        "from": { "moduleId": "ctrl-1", "portId": "cv-out" },
        "to": { "moduleId": "organ-1", "portId": "pitch" },
        "kind": "cv"
      },
      {
        "from": { "moduleId": "ctrl-1", "portId": "gate-out" },
        "to": { "moduleId": "organ-1", "portId": "gate" },
        "kind": "gate"
      },
      {
        "from": { "moduleId": "ctrl-1", "portId": "gate-out" },
        "to": { "moduleId": "adsr-1", "portId": "gate" },
        "kind": "gate"
      },
      {
        "from": { "moduleId": "organ-1", "portId": "out" },
        "to": { "moduleId": "gain-1", "portId": "in" },
        "kind": "audio"
      },
      {
        "from": { "moduleId": "adsr-1", "portId": "env" },
        "to": { "moduleId": "gain-1", "portId": "cv" },
        "kind": "cv"
      },
      {
        "from": { "moduleId": "gain-1", "portId": "out" },
        "to": { "moduleId": "les-1", "portId": "in" },
        "kind": "audio"
      },
      {
        "from": { "moduleId": "les-1", "portId": "out" },
        "to": { "moduleId": "reverb-1", "portId": "in" },
        "kind": "audio"
      },
      {
        "from": { "moduleId": "reverb-1", "portId": "out" },
        "to": { "moduleId": "out-1", "portId": "in" },
        "kind": "audio"
      }
    ]
  }
}
